# Play test of Floe Reach (CIPlay floe_reach, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The camp on the west islet round -40 -30 (3 m); the Nordlys by its east shore, hull x -17..9, z -45.5..-34.5, bow east, her
# deckhouse x -7..-1, z -40.5..-31.5 (floor 5.5 m), the ladder up her south side at -2.5 -45.9; the floes round her and the
# three holes ahead of her bow (14 -30, 14 -50, 19 -29); the plunger on the middle islet at 6 -10; the magazine on the
# north-east islet at 48 58 (5 m); she slides 35 m east when freed.
island Floe Reach
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Breaking the Ice
wait 5
expect animals Goat 2
expect animals Dolphin 2
at -40 -22 h=4
walk -40 -22 to -40 -29 h=3
zone camp
expect step 1
read Captain's order
expect step 2
open Crew's pay chest
expect message FOR WHOEVER FREES HER
at -20 -41 h=1
at -3 -37 h=6.5
zone bridge
expect step 3
open Captain's desk drawer
expect story magazinekey 1
expect step 4
use hole1
expect message wants a charge
zone magazinehut
expect message Two of them
kill Polar bear
expect step 5
open Blasting magazine
expect story charge 3
expect step 6
use hole1
use hole2
use hole3
expect story fuse 3
expect step 7
at 6 -15 h=7
walk 6 -15 to 6 -11 h=6.3
zone plungerridge
expect step 8
use plunger
wait 20
expect shown shipfree
at 28 -37 h=7.5
zone shipfree
expect step 9
read The captain's thanks
expect step 10
open Crew's pay chest
expect done
open Camp supply box
open Sunk sledge
